LEASES/CONTRACTS/LEGAL:
(CA)
Contract between the City of Cheyenne, Laramie County Sheriff’s Department, and Laramie
County for housing city prisoners at the Laramie County Detention Center.  Motion (per consent
agenda) carried. (#5241)
(CA)
Memorandum of Understanding between the City of Cheyenne, Transit Program and Laramie
County, to provide transportation services to Laramie County Community College, the City/County
